            776.319768,
            1359.6372959999999
          ],
          "text": "We have also evaluated the performance of the classification model built directly by IFN (see Section 2.3). This model is based on the same features as \"C4.5 after IFN\", but the model structure may be different due to the IFN restriction of using the same feature at all splits of each layer. The error rate of all models has been measured on the same validation sets. We have also calculated the lower and upper bounds of the 95% confidence interval for the error rate of C4.5 with a full set of features and compared statistically the error rates after different feature selection methods to this \"base'' error rate. The comparison was based on the normal approximation of the binomial distribution.",
